hu̐"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["gaurā pahu̐ nā bhajiyā mainu","prema ratana-dhana helāya hārāinu"],"translation":["Not serving Lord Gaurāṅga, I have died. Negligently I have lost the treasured jewel of divine love."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["adhane yatana kari dhana teyāginu","āpana karama-doṣe āpani ḍubinu"],"translation":["I have endeavoured for worthless things and rejected real wealth. I have drowned myself in my own sins."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["sat-saṅga chhāḍi’ kainu asate vilāsa","te-kāraṇe lāgila ye karma-bandha-phā̐sa"],"translation":["I have avoided the sādhus’ association and enjoyed with wicked people. Thus I have become bound in the noose of my karma."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["viṣaya-viṣama-viṣa satata khāinu","gaura-kīrtana rase magana nā hainu"],"translation":["I have constantly drunk the terrible poison of mundanity and never become immersed in the nectar of Śrī Gaurāṅga’s kīrtan."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["kena vā āchhaye prāṇa ki sukha lāgiyā","narottama dāsa kena nā gela mariyā"],"translation":["Why am I alive? For the sake of what happiness? Why has Narottam Dās not already died?"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gora-panhu-na-bhajiya-mainu","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Gaurā-Pahu-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/gaura-pahu-na-bhajiya-mainu/","description":"Gaurā Pahu̐ — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Gaurā Pahu̐. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"gaura-pahu-na-bhajiya-mainu"}}